/-!
# A259549

Triangle T(n,k) with rows of length 2n-1 filled with consecutive integers, each appearing twice except for the last term, T(n,2n-1) = n(n+1)/2.

The 68 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A259549

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 2, 2, 3, 4, 4, 5, 5, 6, 7,
    7, 8, 8, 9, 9, 10, 11, 11, 12, 12,
    13, 13, 14, 14, 15, 16, 16, 17, 17, 18,
